; Palette (see the comment block in docs/design if a style guide is added later):
;   paper      #F8F3E7   warm off-white panels
;   paper_deep #EDE4D0   chips, idle buttons
;   sand       #D6C9AE   hairline borders
;   ink        #1D2B36   text
;   muted      #5E6C75   secondary text
;   sea        #1E5A78   accent, selected state
;   sea_hover  #2A6D8F
;   sea_tint   #DCEAF0   hover wash
;   focus      #E8890C   gamepad / keyboard focus ring

